Date:   Tue Oct 6 23:12:04 2026 -0700

    fix: portrait doorbell live-view black bars and low-res streams
    
    Near-4:3 sensors (e.g. G6 Pro Entry 3024x4096) now map to the 4:3 family
    via aspect-ratio tolerance, advertise portrait HomeKit sizes when the
    native top is upright, and select channels by long-edge nearest matching
    so landscape 1280x720 probes no longer bind to Low 480x640. Constrained
    Pi hosts use a portrait 1080x1920 substrate target for portrait cameras.

